# RONIN_REPO — this repository's declared arrangement. Read by tools; not inferred.
#
# A repository chooses REVIEWED desks or DIRECT publishing; it is never decided by
# whichever branch happens to be checked out (ronin_sops/github.md). The desk model and
# its boundaries: ronin-cowork/docs/worktrees.md; the network around it:
# docs/control-surface.md. Keys are key=value, one per line, like VERSION.
#
#   mode     reviewed | direct
#   working  the shared development line (reviewed only): funnel point, merged into by
#            team promotion, never edited in place
#   stable   the reviewed/released line; moves only by PR from `working`
#   desks    managed | none — whether sessions work in managed repo desks
#            (branch + worktree cut from their team line) or in the home checkout
#   publish  optional: the lines that may reach the remote, comma-separated
#            (default `dev,master` — only those two ever do, ruled 2026-08-20);
#            read by src/desks/arrangement.ts
#
# A repository without this file is treated as an undeclared shared checkout: the
# legacy commit guard (libexec/ronin-claim) stays on and nothing pretends a desk exists.
mode=reviewed
working=dev
stable=master
desks=managed
